` and `Meter` named `EasyNetQ`."," - **New package `EasyNetQ.AspNetCore.SignalR`**: a SignalR scale-out backplane over EasyNetQ instead of Redis."," - **Packages**: `EasyNetQ` becomes a bundle over `EasyNetQ.Core` and `EasyNetQ.RabbitMQ`; targets","-  `netstandard2.0`, `net10.0`.","+  `netstandard2.0`, `net10.0`, `net11.0`."," "," ## Design direction"," ","@@ -452,7 +452,7 @@ For a git submodule instead of packages, import"," "," # Platform notes"," ","-- Target frameworks: `netstandard2.0`, `net10.0`.","+- Target frameworks: `netstandard2.0`, `net10.0`, `net11.0`."," - .NET Framework 4.7.2+ works through `netstandard2.0` from SDK-style projects. Those binaries skip pooled async","   builders on the publish/consume path; `net10.0`+ is unaffected."," - `IsAotCompatible` is set for Core, RabbitMQ, InMemory and the bundle (net10.0+ assets)."],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/v9-requirements.md","lines":["@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ Working document for the v9 rewrite. Edit as decisions change; the phase plan de"," "," ## Confirmed decisions"," ","-- TFMs: netstandard2.0;net10.0. netstandard2.0 restored 2026-08-31 (maintainer: key selling","+- TFMs: netstandard2.0;net10.0;net11.0. netstandard2.0 restored 2026-08-31 (maintainer: key selling","   point). Mechanism: multi-target the existing csprojs with per-TFM package refs, PolySharp and `#if` — never a","   separate compat or \"latest\" assembly (NuGet TFM asset selection is the isolation mechanism; assembly splits","   break type identity and polyfills cannot cross assemblies). Known limits: .NET Framework consumers need"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"global.json","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@"," {","   \"sdk\": {","-    \"version\": \"10.0.100\",","+    \"version\": \"11.0.100\",","     \"rollForward\": \"latestFeature\"","   }"," }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/package-consumer/PackageConsumer.csproj","lines":["@@ -4,7 +4,8 @@","        publis